# Takeover.srv
# 接管 Servo:BT / 外部调用方向 servo 节点请求"接管并开始跟踪"。
#
# 调用方:BT 薄壳或人工调试
# 服务方:servo 节点(/lgw/servo/takeover)
#
# 输入:
#   track_id      DEPRECATED / ignored (2026-11-17). Servo follows
#                 UnifiedTrackArray.selected_track_id; use
#                 MarkTrack(action=4) to pick a target first.
#   class_filter  DEPRECATED / ignored (same change).
# 输出:
#   success / message / state(接管后的 ServoState 名称)
#
# 见 docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-26-lgw-servo-takeover-design.md §7.2。

# ===== Request =====
uint64 track_id
string class_filter
---

# ===== Response =====
bool success
string message
string state
